      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're not alone in feeling this way, and it's easy to see why you'd think that. The pressure to excel can be overwhelming, and when it doesn't pan out, it's natural to feel like you've failed. But being \"average\" isn't the end of the world - it's just a different path. And let's be real, the people at the top aren't as great as they seem. They've just worked twice as hard, and it's not worth the toll it takes on your mental and physical health.",
